       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
identification division.
program-id. DATEPROBE.
environment division.
configuration section.
repository. function all intrinsic.
data division.
working-storage section.
copy "ST-FIELDS.cpy".
copy "ST-APP.cpy".
01 EXPECTED PIC X(10).
01 W-I PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
procedure division.
    INITIALIZE APP MOVE 200 TO APP-STATUS MOVE 1 TO APP-ERRORS-LENGTH
    ACCEPT R-DATA(F-BIRTHERA) FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT R-DATA(F-BIRTHYEAR) FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT R-DATA(F-BIRTHMONTH) FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT R-DATA(F-BIRTHDAY) FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT BUSINESS-DAY FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    ACCEPT EXPECTED FROM ARGUMENT-VALUE
    IF R-DATA(F-BIRTHYEAR) = "GAN" MOVE "元" TO R-DATA(F-BIRTHYEAR) END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING W-I FROM F-BIRTHERA BY 1 UNTIL W-I > F-BIRTHDAY
      COMPUTE R-LENGTH(W-I) = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(R-DATA(W-I)))
      MOVE 0 TO R-NULL(W-I)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "STDATE" END-CALL
    IF EXPECTED = "INVALID"
      IF APP-STATUS = 200 DISPLAY "FAIL accepted invalid date"
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    ELSE
      IF APP-STATUS NOT = 200 OR N-DATA(4)(1:10) NOT = EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "FAIL " APP-STATUS " " N-DATA(4)(1:10)
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    END-IF
    DISPLAY "PASS " FUNCTION TRIM(EXPECTED)
    STOP RUN RETURNING 0.
end program DATEPROBE.
